# Suricata / Snort Network IDS Rules: Detection of High-Entropy DNS Tunneling
# Targeting recursive port 53 data exfiltration and C2 beaconing (OpenAI Sept 2026 Sandbox Escape Vector)

alert dns any any -> any 53 (msg:"AI-DEFENSE: High-Entropy Base32/Base64 Subdomain Query (Possible LLM Data Exfiltration)"; \
    content:"."; \
    pcre:"/^[a-z0-9\-_]{24,}\./i"; \
    threshold: type both, track by_src, count 20, seconds 10; \
    classtype:bad-unknown; \
    sid:1000901; \
    rev:1;)
